From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ole Algoritme <olealgoritme@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 10:34:47 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] nvk/rm: VK_EXT_image_drm_format_modifier on Windows too

Conduit guest/windows/docs/shared-formats.md section 10: an NVK process
opening a LINEAR surface whose pitch is not NVK's own choice (a KMD-made
RM surface such as a GDI redirection surface, or a linear NVK one) must
build its image with the recorded pitch and offset. NVK already takes
VkImageDrmFormatModifierExplicitCreateInfoEXT (nil accepts imported
LINEAR pitches down to 32 B) and the RM backend applies kinds per
mapping, so only the advertisement was missing: has_alloc_tiled no longer
depends on the DRM path. The Helios shared-surface import check then
matches the explicit layout by construction. NVK_HELIOS_MODIFIERS=0
hides the extension on Windows.
---
 src/nouveau/vulkan/nvkmd/rm/nvkmd_rm.h      | 5 +++--
 src/nouveau/vulkan/nvkmd/rm/nvkmd_rm_pdev.c | 8 ++++++--
 2 files changed, 9 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/nouveau/vulkan/nvkmd/rm/nvkmd_rm.h b/src/nouveau/vulkan/nvkmd/rm/nvkmd_rm.h
index e03d9cf..47d7e44 100644
--- a/src/nouveau/vulkan/nvkmd/rm/nvkmd_rm.h
+++ b/src/nouveau/vulkan/nvkmd/rm/nvkmd_rm.h
@@ -395,8 +395,9 @@ void nvkmd_rm_free_memory(struct nvkmd_rm_dev *dev, uint32_t h_memory);
 
 /*
  * DRM: nvidia-drm node discovery, dma-buf export/import (nvkmd_rm_drm.c).
- * Linux only.  Without it (Windows) there are no dma-bufs and no DRM format
- * modifiers: has_dma_buf and has_alloc_tiled stay false.
+ * Linux only.  Without it (Windows) there are no dma-bufs: has_dma_buf stays
+ * false.  DRM format modifiers stay (has_alloc_tiled): images with an explicit
+ * layout need no dma-buf.
  */
 
 #ifdef NVK_RM_WITH_DRM
diff --git a/src/nouveau/vulkan/nvkmd/rm/nvkmd_rm_pdev.c b/src/nouveau/vulkan/nvkmd/rm/nvkmd_rm_pdev.c
index 6ef4528..2903b92 100644
--- a/src/nouveau/vulkan/nvkmd/rm/nvkmd_rm_pdev.c
+++ b/src/nouveau/vulkan/nvkmd/rm/nvkmd_rm_pdev.c
@@ -404,9 +404,13 @@ nvkmd_rm_try_create_pdev(const struct nvkmd_rm_lib *lib,
       .has_get_vram_used = true,
       /* Kinds are applied per mapping; a "tiled" allocation only records
        * the layout for NVKMS.  This is what enables
-       * VK_EXT_image_drm_format_modifier.
+       * VK_EXT_image_drm_format_modifier.  On Windows too (Conduit
+       * shared-formats.md section 10): a Helios opener imports a LINEAR
+       * surface the KMD made with its recorded pitch through an explicit
+       * modifier layout.  NVK_HELIOS_MODIFIERS=0 hides it there.
        */
-      .has_alloc_tiled = NVKMD_RM_WITH_DRM,
+      .has_alloc_tiled = NVKMD_RM_WITH_DRM ||
+                         debug_get_bool_option("NVK_HELIOS_MODIFIERS", true),
       .has_map_fixed = false,
       .has_overmap = false,
       /* GB20x: compressible generic memory (see nvkmd_rm_mem.c) */
-- 
